diff --git a/examples/sampling_c3/anything/README.md b/examples/sampling_c3/anything/README.md
index 19df6a6..bfed0c5 100644
--- a/examples/sampling_c3/anything/README.md
+++ b/examples/sampling_c3/anything/README.md
@@ -87,0 +88,8 @@ When you start an experiment, `multi_rewrite` reads `base_names` and updates the
+An optional `sampling_meshes` list in
+`parameters/sampling_c3_controller_params.yaml` can override only the meshes
+used for global surface sampling.  It must have the same order and length as
+`base_names`.  The complete `object_models` are still used for dynamics and
+contact geometry.  This hook supports safe-only semantic sampling without
+removing protected/neutral geometry from the physical model.  Omitting the key
+preserves the original behavior.
+
diff --git a/examples/sampling_c3/parameter_headers/sampling_c3_controller_params.h b/examples/sampling_c3/parameter_headers/sampling_c3_controller_params.h
